Minor spoilers

You can:
- eat a mind flayer
- quaff a potion of gain ability.  Blessed it increases all of your 
  stats, unblessed it only increases one, which might not be intelligence
- wear a helm of brilliance.  It has to be enchanted to get any benefit.  
  You get +1 intelligence per plus on the helm.  This can increase your 
  intelligence beyond 18, unlike the previous 2 methods.   Unlike the 
  previous two methods, its only temporary.

